'''Benjamin "Ben" Kirby Tennyson''', nicknamed '''Ben 10,000''', is a full-time superhero and one of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]]'s possible futures.{{Ben 10k Timeline Note}}

==Appearance==
Ben 10,000 has a tall, muscular build, which is due to the various adventures he has experienced that have left him in shape.{{Refn|[[:File:Why is Ben 10,000 muscular.png]]|group = DR}} He is 6'3".{{Refn|''link unavailable''|group = TNP}} 

In ''[[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|Ben 10,000]]'', his outfit consisted of a black t-shirt with a white stripe and accents, and army green pants. He wore a black belt, fingerless gloves and boots.

In ''[[Ken 10]]'', he now sports a goatee, His brown hair now greying at the temples and the back, and his t-shirt's color scheme is inverted, mirroring his classic shirt he wore as a child. His belt now has pouches.

In '''Omniverse''', he now wears a white t-shirt with a green stripe and accents. He has a new belt, with the number "10K" on it in green, and dark gray kneepads. His boots now have silver and white bits, and his cargo green pants have pouches.

===Occasional Appearances===
Ben 10,000 wears red pajamas at nighttime.

