==Personality==
{{Quote|Okay, tell me I didn't just say "thus." Don't I have any fun anymore?<br>You'll learn soon enough. Being me is not about fun.|10 year old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] and Ben 10,000.<ref name="Ben 10,000" />}}
When he is introduced, Ben 10,000 was portrayed as extremely serious about the hero business to the point where it was almost obsessive. He spent most of his time as [[XLR8 (Classic)|XLR8]] to patrol the planet{{Refn|group = pop-up|name = "XRL8"}}<ref name="Ben 10,000" /> and brutalized criminals as quickly as he could, while rarely appearing in [[Human (Classic)|human]] form. He had also stopped naming his aliens, which [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]] considers "half the fun" of using them. Ben stayed this serious until [[Dr. Gwendolyn Tennyson|Gwendolyn]] brought his 10 year old self to talk to him.

After taking on [[Vilgax (Original Future)|Vilgax]] alongside young Ben, Ben 10,000 started to lighten up in time for [[Max Tennyson (Original Future)|Max]]'s 80th birthday. Over the following twelve years, he changed his clothing to something akin to his youth, reflecting his emotional journey, returned to naming his aliens again, and spent quality time with his [[Ken Tennyson (Original)|son]]. Furthermore, he and Gwendolyn again rely on each other now as their relationship has grown.{{Refn|[[:File:Ken 10 Pop-up (17).png]]|group = pop-up|name = relatiship}}<ref name="Ken 10"/>

While he tries to be close with his son, Ben 10,000 sometimes doubts his abilities as a parent and become over-protective due to the various dangers of crimefighting. He can also be somewhat obtuse, not realizing where his son got his attitude from and grasping the obvious to Max's annoyance.<ref name="Ken 10" />

Despite his change to a more light-hearted and relaxed person, Ben 10,000 has a ferocious temper that returns him to his more aggressive and grimmer personage he displayed up until his thirties. The best example of this is when he transformed into [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]] and viciously pounded [[Kevin 11,000]] into the ground for attacking Ken.<ref name="Ken 10" />

Ben 10,000 also possesses a commendable amount of bravery and courage. Upon seeing the detonation of [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]]'s [[Chronosapien Time Bomb]], rather than panicking and trying to run, he fearlessly charged towards it and tried to stop it with [[Atomic-X]], only to fail.<ref>''[[And Then There Were None]]''</ref> He is also perfectly willing to fight his enemies up close, even while unable to transform.<ref name="TEoaE"/>

While experienced and mature, Ben 10,000 has shown to again have a teasing side, calling the alternate counterpart of his cousin [[Gwen 10 (Gweniverse)|Gwen 10]] "dweeb" when she made a smart quip about him,<ref>''[[And Then There Was Ben]]''</ref> something 10 year old Ben noticed Ben 10,000 had stopped doing.<ref name="Ben 10,000" /> He is also a bit nostalgic of an earlier time in his life, having fond memories of [[Skurd]], the [[Proto-TRUK]], and the [[Tenn-Speed]].<ref name="LDtTWA" />

==History==
===Background===
Ben 10,000 had stayed cocky and happy until he was 20.{{Refn|group = note|This was originally stated to occur when Ben was 15 years old, placing it during '''Alien Force''',{{Refn|group = pop-up|name = tragedy}}<ref name="Ben 10,000" /> but was later changed to when Ben was 20 years old.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben 10K Now Serious At 20.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[Contradictory Retcons (Classic)|Contradictory Retcons]]|name = retcon|group = BTP}}}} It remains unclear on the details about what happened that caused this change, but it caused him to become strict, cynical, and distant from his family for several years. During this period, he mutilated [[Vilgax (Original Future)|Vilgax]] and put away his remains in a stasis pod in [[Fort DNA-X]] to make sure he could no longer harm anyone.

Over the years, Ben began to have more practice with his aliens, and improving them with nanotechnology.{{Refn|[[:File:Future Ben Enhances His Aliens.png]]|name = nano|group = pop-up}}<ref name="Ben 10,000" /> He eventually unlocked 10,000 aliens,{{Refn|[[:File:Ben10K's Omnitrix Transforms.png]]|name = "10k"|group = pop-up}}<ref name="Ben 10,000" /> which would lead him to call himself "Ben 10,000". Soon he also would earn the title of "Hero of Heroes" and occasionally went on patrol around the planet against enemies for 24 hours.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben10K XLR8 Patrol.png]]|group = pop-up|name = "XRL8"}}<ref name="Ben 10,000" />

===Ben 10===
Ben 10,000 first appeared in [[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|his self-titled episode]], where after detecting a conflict in [[Omnitrix City|Omnitrix City]] caused by [[Exo-Skull|Exo-Skull]], Ben 10,000 as [[XLR8 (Classic)|XLR8]] goes to the scene and stops him from attacking [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] and [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] from the [[Prime Timeline]], beating him and breaking his horn. XLR8 analyzes the villain and suggests it could be the work of [[Dr. Animo (Original Future)|Dr. Animo]]. He also realizes that his counterpart was there with his cousin, and orders [[Dr. Gwendolyn Tennyson|Gwendolyn]] to take them back to the past.

[[File:B10Mil (147).png|thumb|left|Ben 10,000 and Young Ben]]
Young Ben recognizes him as a future version of himself and is amazed to learn that he has a Headquarters and asks how to unlock the 9,990 aliens he doesn't have. However, Ben 10,000 is arrogant and ignorantly responds that he would never reveal it and continues to patrol the planet. Ben 10,000 then goes to sector "15-D" of Fort DNA-X, which was being attacked by Dr. Animo. Ben 10,000 fights him as [[Four Arms (Classic)|Four Arms]] and ends up being hindered by young Ben as [[Stinkfly (Classic)|Stinkfly]], who has his stinger trapped by Four Arms who returns to the battle. Ben 10,000 can easily defeat Dr. Animo and soon after, the [[Galactic Enforcers (Original Future)|Galactic Enforces]] arrive at the scene and mock Ben for not letting them beat Dr. Animo. Ben 10,000 turns into XLR8 and says that they would lose if the battle were with them, as well as asking them to trap Animal in the [[Null Void (Classic)|Null Void]].

Ben 10,000 grabs young Ben and Gwen and takes them to his [[Ben 10,000 Tower|headquarters]]. Upon arriving at the headquarters, young Ben ends up arguing with Ben 10,000 about how he would stop being a hero at that rate, until an alarm goes off reporting an invasion in the "1-A Center" sector. Young Ben asks what was going on but XLR8 replies that he didn't know, but it was just his problem.

[[File:B10Mil (525).png|thumb|right|Ben 10,000 vs Vilgax]]
Ben 10,000 arrives at the site of the invasion, which reveals itself to be the place where the Null Void Chamber is located. He prepares to face Animo again, but is soon interrupted by Vilgax, who immediately rushes to attack him. Ben 10,000 finds himself at a disadvantage during the fight, but is soon, however reluctantly, helped by young Ben as [[Upgrade (Classic)|Upgrade]]. The two Bens together begin to fight Vilgax, but their efforts did not work.

[[File:B10Mil (604).png|thumb|left|Ben gets through to Ben 10,000]]
In the middle of the fight, Ben says that Vilgax may even know how his aliens fight, but does he know what Ben is capable of, and argues that he hopes that after so long, Ben 10,000 hasn't forgotten what it's like to be a true hero. Then Four Arms transforms back into Ben 10,000, and says it was time to start fighting like young Ben. Ben 10,000 holds a [[hoverboard]] and transforms the young man from Cannonbolt into [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]]. With just a Hoverboard, Ben 10,000 manages to destabilize Vilgax, and then uses [[Spitter]] to push Vilgax into place, which he would freeze like [[Arctiguana]].

[[File:B10Mil (725).png|thumb|right|Ben 10,000 giving Ben a cube]]
Later, Ben 10,000 along with Gwendolyn and the young Ben and Gwen celebrate [[Max Tennyson (Original Future)|Max]]'s 80th birthday. Gwendolyn opens the portal for the young people to return to their time, but young Ben asks Ben 10,000 the secrets of the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]], and also how not to be "Ben" again. Ben 10,000 says that he will want to be "Ben" again, and thanks him for making him understand in addition to handing him a [[Transforming Storage Cube|cube]] that later turns out to be a simple cake for Max, who should have delivered it 20 years ago. Ben 10,000, Gwendolyn and Max say goodbye to the young people with a brief smile.

After his encounter with his younger self, Ben 10,000 began to change his attitude,{{Refn|[[:File:DJW came up with Biomnitrix.png]]|group = DJW|name=Biomni}} becoming closer to his family, especially Gwendolyn.{{Refn|group = pop-up|name = relatiship}}<ref name="Ken 10"/> Furthermore, he also married his childhood love interest, [[Kai Tennyson|Kai]], and with her he had two children, [[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Ken]] and [[Gwendolyn Tennyson (Ben's Daughter)|Gwen]].{{Refn|group = pop-up|[[:File:OS Ben 10,000 Has Two Kids.png]]|name = Ben10k}}<ref name="Ben 10,000">''[[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|Ben 10,000]]''</ref>{{Refn|group = pop-up|[[:File:OS Ben 10,000 Has Two Kids 2.png]]| name = Two}}<ref name= "Benwolf">''[[Benwolf]]''</ref> In preparation for his son's 10th birthday, Ben used his smartest aliens to create [[Omnitrix (Ken's Replica)|a replica Omnitrix]]{{Refn|[[:File:Aliens Ben 10,000 Used to Create Ken's Omnitrix.png]]|group = pop-up|name = Ken 10 omnitrix}}<ref name="Ken 10" /> that behaves much like the first one he wore in his youth.

[[File:Ken26.png|thumb|left|Ben 10,000 and Ken]]
In ''[[Ken 10]]'', Ben 10,000 defeated [[Vulkanus]] just in time to attend Ken's birthday and gave him his own Omnitrix. An alarm soon rings and Ben 10,000 along with Ken go to fight [[Sploot]] and [[Mot Snikrep]], both being defeated only by Ben 10,000.

Back at headquarters, Max asks how the pair's day was, and Ben responds that they had won, however, Ken responds that he was left out of the action. Ben comments that having an Omnitrix didn't make him a hero, says that Ken's duty was to observe, learn and only then enter battle safely. Arrogantly, Ken grabs his hoverboard and goes for a ride, leaving Ben thoughtful. In the middle of the night, the General Headquarters was being invaded. Ben tells Ken they will take care of the invader together. However the intruder was supposedly [[Kevin Levin (Original Future)|Kevin]], leaving Ben surprised and initiating the emergency lockdown. Ben 10,000 becomes Four Arms and orders Kenny to go to his room against his will, despite saying they would stop the invader together as Kevin was unpredictable.

[[File:K10 (230.1).png|thumb|right|Ben 10,000 and the supposed Kevin]]
The two soon face each other, and the supposed Kevin reveals that he is there by the Null Void Chamber, but Ben reveals that he moved it. Before Ben has the chance to trap Kevin in a Containment Egg, Ken appears trapped in the air vent, giving Kevin an opening to escape. Ben 10,000 transforms into [[Snare-Oh]], who pulls Ken out of the air vent. With a disapproving look, Ben 10,000 is questioned by Ken, who complains about his father's lack of faith and trust.

Later, in a conversation with Gwendolyn, Ben says he thinks Ken wants to become a hero, but Gwendolyn thinks he is seeing the situation from the wrong angle, saying that all parents have problems letting their children grow up and emphasizes Ben, as being living proof that children have to make mistakes. Gwendolyn also advises Ben to give Ken a chance, so he would gain her trust.

[[File:K10 (387).png|thumb|left|Ben 10,000 and Kevin 11,000]]
An alarm goes off from the room that the Null Void Chamber is contained in. Ben 10,000 becomes XLR8 and goes to the location, finding Kenny and Max tied up there. He is suddenly attacked by "Kevin", however, he quickly dodges. Ben becomes Four Arms and jokes that the attempted attack was "silly". However, he is amazed to find the real Kevin, who had been released from the Null Void by "Kevin", who was actually his son, [[Devlin Levin|Devlin]]. Kevin explains that while he was trapped there, he could absorb the powers of all the aliens that Ben trapped there and then transforms into [[Kevin 11,000]].

They then begin to fight, Kevin 11,000 has the advantage in the fight and immobilizes Ben as Diamondhead by using an [[Loboan (Classic)|Loboan]]'s sonic howl. However, after falling unconscious, Ken and Devlin try to fight Kevin and almost lose. Upon seeing his son fallen, Ben became furious and transformed into [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]], suddenly crushing him.

[[File:K10 (518).png|thumb|right|The end of battle]]
After venting his anger, Ben runs to help Ken, who says he's fine, as well as delivering a Confinement Egg. Kevin reacts and retaliates by pushing father and son away, but the egg remains on the ground, causing Kevin to then be sucked into the object pushed by Devlin. Ben 10,000 congratulates Ken on his work, and his son asks if he could use the 10,000 aliens from the Omnitrix, making Ben proud despite saying that Ken could only be dreaming. At the end of the battle, Ben and Max decide to invite Devlin to join their family, since he no longer has a father to guide him, which he accepts.

===Between Ben 10 and Omniverse===
At some point Ben 10,000 would develop a dual-Omnitrix system called the [[Biomnitrix]]{{Refn|[[:File:Biomnitrix Name Reveal.png]]|group = DJW}} with the help of his smartest aliens.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben 10,000 Smartest aliens.PNG]]|group = DJW|name = unavail}} He also started taking part in the [[Time War]].

Ben gave the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] to Ken, however, at some point after, Ben took the Omnitrix away from him for going on an unauthorized mission.{{Refn|[[:File:Why Ken Lost His Omnitrix.png]]|group = DJW}}

===Omniverse===
[[File:BA 494.PNG|thumb|left|Ben 10,000 looking for Paradox]]
Ben 10,000 first reappeared in ''[[Ben Again]]'', where he came to 16-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s time looking for [[Professor Paradox]], stating that time was getting out of hand due to the [[Chronosapien]]s having gone rogue and [[Maltruant]]'s [[Time Beast|temporal beast]]s going on a cross-dimensional rampage.

In ''[[And Then There Were None]]'', Ben 10,000 arrived along with [[Gwen 10 (Gweniverse)|Gwen 10]] and [[Ben 23]] to assist in the battle against the evil Bens, courtesy of Professor Paradox. Transforming into [[Fourmungousaur]], he fought [[Mad Ben]] as [[Rath (Classic)|Rath]] and [[Benzarro]] as [[Snare-Oh]] until the [[Chronosapien Time Bomb]] went off. Ben 10,000 tried to stop the bomb by using [[Atomic-X]] but was erased from existence, just like the other Bens.

[[File:TWB (313).png|thumb|Ben 10,000 in his tower]]
In ''[[And Then There Was Ben]]'', Ben 10,000 was visited by Professor Paradox and the other alternate Bens to be recruited for the ultimate battle against [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]]. Later, he was brought back into existence by [[Ben Tennyson (No Watch Timeline)|No Watch Ben]] as [[Clockwork]]. Ben 10,000 and his fellow Bens battled Vilgax together and won. He was then sent back to [[Original Future Timeline|his own timeline]] after escorting the good Omnitrix wielders to their timelines.

In ''[[Fight at the Museum]]'', Ben 10,000 hugged his beloved wife [[Kai Tennyson|Kai]] after she found the [[Orb of Pumapunku]].

[[File:LDtTWA (236).png|thumb|left|Ben 10,000 and Paradox]]
In ''[[Let's Do the Time War Again]]'', Professor Paradox brought Ben 10,000 to the present to help contain the rampage of a Time Beast. Using [[Crashocker]], he fought [[Exo-Skull]] and [[Subdora]] and later used [[Uprigg]] to rebuild the destroyed [[Proto-TRUK]] and [[Tenn-Speed]] into [[Time Cycles]]. Returning to the past once more after his past self destroyed [[Bellwood (Classic)|Bellwood]], he fought [[Eon's Minions|Eon's minions]] as [[Big Chuck]]. Once the crisis was resolved, Paradox took Ben 10,000 back in time to close the time loop that they created before sending him back to his own time.

In ''[[The End of an Era]]'', Ben and Kai tried to stop [[Dr. Animo (Original Future)|Dr. Animo]] from using the [[Chronoporter]] to escape to the past but failed. They were then surprised when Spanner brought Animo back seconds later. Ben greeted him warmly, remarking that he had not seen him in years. Ben called for [[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Ken]], who came into the room, carrying the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] (which Kai confiscated, as he was grounded), and was confused by Spanner suddenly vanishing.

The family teleported to [[Plumber Headquarters (Omniverse)|Plumber Headquarters]] to attend [[Max Tennyson (Original Future)|Max]]'s retirement party, bringing Animo to be imprisoned. In the middle of the party, the power suddenly went out due to a solar flare. [[Dr. Gwendolyn Tennyson|Gwendolyn]] sensed [[Maltruant]]'s presence, and she, Ben and Kai went to confront him. After briefly being unable to use the [[Biomnitrix]] due to the solar flares, Ben battled Maltruant as Atomic-X.

[[File:TEoaE (527).png|thumb|Ben 10,000 discovering that Ken is Spanner]]
When Spanner appeared on the scene, Atomic-X defended him from a blast from Maltruant, changing back to Ben. Spanner called Ben "Dad", revealing that he is Ken, having been given his suit by Professor Paradox. Ben told Ken to go back in time and get help. Shortly after, he, Kai, and Gwendolyn were frozen in time by Maltruant. When Ken returned with the present-day Ben and [[Rook Blonko|Rook]], Ken unleashed some [[Techadon Robot]]s, one of whom saved Ben 10,000 after he was thrown into space by Maltruant.

In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Ben 10,000 was no longer frozen in time and was given the wounded Ken to take care of by his younger self. Ben grounded Ken for not telling him he was Spanner.{{Refn|[[:File:Kenny OV Grounded.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow">
TEoaE (540).png|Skilled Hand-to-Hand Combatant
TEoaE (543).png|Enhanced Reflexes
B10Mil (650).png|Enhanced Acrobatics
</gallery>
Ben 10,000 has become a highly skilled combatant, showing that he is no longer as dependent on the Omnitrix as he was when he was young, and can easily fight strong opponents, as seen when he managed to destabilize Maltruant with just a few punches.<ref name="TEoaE"/>

Ben 10,000 is highly acrobatic, able to execute a backward somersault off a [[Hoverboard|hoverboard]] in mid-air.<ref name="Ben 10,000" />

Ben 10,000 has enhanced reflexes, allowing him to dodge attacks with ease.<ref name="Ben 10,000" />

When presented with a problem, Ben 10,000 presents a quick and logical response to it. His intelligence is most evident by his creation of [[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Ken]]'s [[Omnitrix (Ken's Replica)|Omnitrix]] via the collaboration of multiple intelligent transformations.{{Refn|group = pop-up|name = Ken 10 omnitrix}}<ref name="Ken 10"/> His sharp mind allows him to take advantage of most situations and turn the tide in his favor.

===Equipment===
<gallery type="slideshow">
LDtTWA (325).png|Biomnitrix
