Ben 10,000 can transform into any of his aliens at will, due to having unlocked the Master Control. As Ben got older, the [[Omnitrix (Original Future)|Omnitrix]] also transformed, thereby giving him more control and access to more aliens.{{Refn|name = "10k"|group = pop-up}}<ref name="Ben 10,000" /> Ben 10,000 has mastered his alien forms and is capable of using their powers to their fullest potential. This is thanks to both years of practice and Ben enhancing each of his aliens with nanotech.{{Refn|[[:File:Future Ben Enhances His Aliens.png]]|name = nano|group = pop-up}}<ref name="Ben 10,000" /> As such, the aliens themselves have changed, with their appearances being different and their abilities being at greater levels.

He can also fuse any two aliens from the [[Omnitrix]] database with his [[Biomnitrix]] system.

Ben 10,000 carries [[Null Void Containment Egg]]s to imprison his enemies.<ref name="Ken 10"/>

Ben 10,000 owned a [[Hoverboard|hoverboard]], which was destroyed by [[Vilgax (Original Future)|Vilgax]].<ref name="Ben 10,000" />

Ben 10,000 briefly was in possession of the one of [[Time Cycles]].<ref name="LDtTWA" />

==Weaknesses==
Prior to meeting [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|his young counterpart]], Ben 10,000 would use a repeated method over several years, and as such, anyone who has knowledge of his tactics such as [[Vilgax (Original Future)|Vilgax]] would easily overcome him until Ben 10,000 began using juvenile antics.<ref name="Ben 10,000" />

Much like any version of Ben, Ben 10,000 is unable to take on any stronger enemies without the help of the [[Omnitrix (Original Future)|Omnitrix]] and he can be a bit of a hothead.

