=====Ben 10=====
*''[[The Once and Future Ben]]''

==Comics==
===Cartoon Network Action Pack!===
In ''[[The Once and Future Ben]]'', after [[Vilgax (Original Future)|Vilgax]]'s defeat, Ben 10,000 becomes the target of his descendant, [[Vilgax 3000]], who uses a small teleportation device to travel through time to avenge his ancestor.

Ben 10,000 as [[Spitter]] and Vilgax 3000 engage in a battle, and the villain realizes he couldn't defeat him in that timeline because he possessed remarkable knowledge of the [[Omnitrix (Original Future)|Omnitrix]]. After the villain travels even further back in time, Ben 10,000, along with [[Dr. Gwendolyn Tennyson|Gwendolyn]], also travel back in time in search of the futuristic villain. The duo emerge from the time portal just as Vilgax 3000 is about to kill [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|young Ben]], thus preventing the murder. Ben 10,000 says that the villain had obviously failed, and then repairs young Ben's [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]], which had been altered by Vilgax 3000, in addition to adding [[Arctiguana]]'s DNA to the Omnitrix.

Young Ben and Ben 10,000 transform into Arctiguana and, along with Gwendolyn, easily defeat Vilgax 3000 by freezing him. Ben 10,000 tells the older Gwen that he doesn't remember what happened when he was a child and asks her to erase the memories of young Ben and [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]]. Ben 10,000 then hides Vigax 3000 in the Ice Age, 20,000 years before their time.

==Trivia==
*Ben 10,000's original series design was done [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]], and his Omniverse design was by [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] and [[Chap Yaep]].{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Designed S3 & S4 Characters.png]]|group = TNP}}{{Refn|[[:File:Time_Warriors_OV_design_credits_.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Prior to the introduction of [[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Ken]], Perkins had a story in mind for how the tale of Ben Tennyson would eventually lead to a successor for the [[Omnitrix]].{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Perkins Ben 10K Successor.PNG]]|group = TNP}}
*[[Judd Nelson]] was chosen for the role in '''Omniverse''' because [[Matt Youngberg]] felt that Judd's voice sounded like it was in between that of [[Yuri Lowenthal]]'s and [[Paul Eiding]]'s.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben10K Voice.png]]|group = DJW}} 
*Derrick would have cast [[Wikipedia:Robert Downey Jr.|Robert Downey Jr.]] as a live-action Ben 10,000 if he got to choose who would play the role.{{Refn|https://archive.fo/MSTt9|group = DJW}}

